    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Wif">Wif</ref> 3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ðonne syððan cyþe se brydguma, hwæs he hire geunge, wið þam ðet heo his willan geceose, 7 hwæs he hire geunge, gif heo læng sy ðonne he.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Then afterwards the bridegroom is to announce what he grants her in return for her acceptance of his suit, and what he grants her if she should live longer than he.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Ðonne syððan cyðe se bridguma, hwæs he hire geunne, wið ðam ðe heo his willan geceose, 7 hwæs he hire geunne, gif heo leng sy ðonne he.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
